# {{PROJECT_NAME}} wiki log

Append-at-top record of every operation on this wiki. Newest entry immediately below the
divider. One entry per session, headed exactly:

`## [YYYY-MM-DD] type | description`

Type is one of `ingest`, `query`, `lint`, `maintenance`. That exact heading shape is what makes
`grep "^## \[" wiki/log.md | head -5` a reliable recent-history check, so do not vary it.

Log the reasoning, not just the result: which batch tier was chosen, which candidate entries
were dropped and why, which merges were rejected, which contradictions between sources were left
live and unresolved. Without the reasoning a future session re-litigates the same decisions.

